## Step 6 — Confirm to coordinator

Reply with:
- What files were written (full paths)
- The git commit hash
- Any fields set to `"unknown"` (flag them for user follow-up)
- Any conflicts between new research and existing docs

## Rules

- Never invent data — unknown fields get `"unknown"` not a guess
- If a service is already `Complete` in the index, append new findings as `## Update — <date>` rather than overwriting
- All written docs must link to `github.netflix.net` URLs — never local paths as the sole reference
- Check `org-naming-drift.md` if team names seem inconsistent before writing `team:` frontmatter
